    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "Say Ed Sheeran can’t get enough of your body, composed of seven equal sides and angles, and wants “The Shape of You” lyrics to reflect that.",
      "n": "QuestionText1"
    },
    {
      "s": "Bonne chance pour trouver un maillot de bain ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "720424_1",
      "n": "CategoryAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Non, le HENDECAGON a 11 côtés, et Ed n’aime pas ça. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "720436_1",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio3"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "IntroAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "720427_1",
      "n": "ChoicesAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Le DODÉCAGON possède douze faces succulentes. Trop pour Ed, mais n'intériorise pas ça, ma fille, tu es BELLE comme tu es ! ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "720434_3",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio2"
    },
    {
      "s": "UN NONAGONE a neuf côtés, et NON de cette réponse est correcte. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "720432_1",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio1"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "A HEPTAGON is composed of seven identical sides and angles.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "720429_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "...making it a shape as complicated and profound as the musical stylings of Ed Sheeran.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "720430_1",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Say Ed Sheeran can’t get enough of your body, composed of seven equal sides and angles, and wants “The Shape of You” lyrics to reflect that. What should Ed sing?",
      "t": "A",
